{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_5_level_main_05-09_beg","groupId":"main_5","stageId":"main_05-09","title":"孽生惡物","storyCode":"5-9","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_05-09_beg.txt","sourceHash":"3b2dab66f541f47f6c706f4598b7760ad07e18bac380055b9265389e6e7e9da9","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第六关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_3"},{"type":"narration","text":"11:20 P.M.  天氣/陰\n龍門上城區，近衛局二樓出入境辦事處外"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"陳sir，不對勁，我們這樣就潛入了近衛局，會不會太容易了點？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"大樓外盤踞著那麼多的整合運動，我們都已經做好了攻堅的準備，但他們簡直就像是在夢遊一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"根據偵察員的觀察，他們的裝備也基本破損到了不能使用的地步，很難想像他們經歷了什麼樣的戰鬥，他們現在的狀態也讓人感到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"毛骨悚然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我也發現了，他們沒意識到我們的存在。至少現在的他們構不成威脅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"按照計畫，接下來，非作戰小隊要逐層探查整合運動的分佈，重新啟動之前我們關閉的安全保衛系統。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，做好抵禦整合運動圍攻的準備，我們要堅持到計畫順利實施為止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"把注意力放在大樓內部的情況上吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"根據線報，整合運動將臨時指揮部設在了天台。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"天台？什麼樣的整合運動領袖，會把指揮部設在天台？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......是陷阱的可能性很大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們別無選擇，是嗎長官？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。攻下天台如同點燃龍門的防煙，我們得讓整合運動看到近衛局重歸龍門的那一刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"該把他們全都引過來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"還有幾個小時，準備好。讓偵察小隊和工程小隊先行；發動總攻前，我們作戰小隊還有一點養精蓄銳的時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"別浪費哪怕是點滴用以創造優勢的機會。要做好遭遇敵人殊死抵抗的準備。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"報告陳sir，我覺得近衛局大樓裡有些古怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你是指什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"先說結論吧。在接近頂樓的區域，我們可能會遭遇整合運動的抵抗，天台上也分佈著一定的敵方武力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"然而，大樓低層全部空無一人，六層開始出現了一些那種整合運動的遊蕩者，越接近高層遊蕩者越多，卻都沒有什麼威脅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才我的隊員向我報告，他似乎看到了有整合運動成員走過走廊，一眨眼卻不見了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"還有隊員說，他們聽到了竊竊私語的聲音，調查聲音的方向時卻一無所獲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"這是偵查的結果。但我依然覺得不對勁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"先走。沒時間搞什麼猛警凶局了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"就算有什麼靈異，也給我等到事情結束後再清理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes sir！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"走這裡的防火通道。養兵千日用兵一時，雖然平常都很少打掃它，現在就全靠它了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"爬上這條樓梯，就是近衛局天台。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"你們去攻佔頂樓，借助視野優勢援護我。我去天台，局勢穩定後我們再合流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"陳sir，你真的要一個人去嗎？無論局勢怎麼樣，我們其實都能幫上些忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"我完全相信你們的素養和戰鬥能力。但這場戰鬥，我可能需要全力發揮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"幫我斷絕後顧之憂、以及清理整座近衛局大樓，反而是各位最重要的任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們就不去礙手礙腳了，陳sir.  龍門就靠你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"錯了。是龍門就靠我們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rooftop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎你的到來，長官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"一個人就敢衝上我佈置好的陷阱，你究竟是魯莽還是蠻勇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你無處可去了，整合運動的指揮官。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？從我的角度看，是長官你無路可逃了。我的同胞們會將你淹沒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"多說無益，齊上吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡不是整合運動該來的地方！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陳"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["近衛局成員","陳"]},{"speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","aliases":["？？？","梅菲斯特"]}]}
